  "description": "EPUB 3 export for DocWright: a dependency-free packager producing a conforming, reader-ready OCF container with an OPF package document, an EPUB 3 navigation document and one XHTML content document per chapter, validated against EPUBCheck. Export only — there is no EPUB reader. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
